.react-router
build
# Must be ** prefixed: a bare `node_modules` matches only the root one, letting
# the host's apps/*/node_modules into the image, where its pnpm symlinks point
# at peer-dependency hashes the container's own install never produced.
**/node_modules
**/.react-router
**/dist
**/build
README.md

# Secrets must never reach a build context that is pushed to a public registry.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.github
.husky
.nx
.vercel
.vscode
docs
deploy
**/coverage
**/*.log
